    ["笔记的封皮完全由深黑色硬纸制成，散发出古\n老悠远的气息，丝毫没有变软和腐烂的迹象。\n\n一阵剧烈的头痛骤然袭来，仿佛是来自记忆深\n处的危险警示，阻止你翻开这本笔记。\n\n你发现书页中好像夹着什么。"] = "The cover of the notebook is made entirely of deep black hard paper, exuding an ancient and distant aura, with no signs of softening or decay whatsoever.\n\n\n A sudden, intense headache strikes, as if it were a dangerous warning from the depths of your memory, preventing you from opening this notebook.\n\n\n You discover that something seems to be tucked between the pages.",
